<div class="page-header"><h1>Become a Kitchen Cabinet Dealer in San Diego, CA</h1><p>Pinnacle Sales is the manufacturer's representative for five premium cabinetry brands — Shiloh, Eclipse, Aspect, Pronorm German Kitchens, and Vistora Closets — recruiting and supporting kitchen & bath dealers across San Diego County.</p></div>
