<h2 id="why-partner-with-pinnacle">Why Partner With Pinnacle Sales in San Diego</h2>
<p>If you run a kitchen & bath showroom or design studio in San Diego, Pinnacle Sales gives you a portfolio that spans every market tier — from semi-custom value to handleless German luxury — backed by 23+ years of hands-on dealer support. From La Jolla and Del Mar to Rancho Santa Fe, Carlsbad, and Coronado, San Diego kitchens favor relaxed coastal-contemporary design with abundant natural light. We offer protected territory, line training, and the design and merchandising help your team needs to win high-end coastal projects.</p>

<h2 id="lines-you-can-carry">Premium Lines You Can Carry</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">Eclipse Cabinetry</a></strong> — Frameless, full-access for clean coastal-contemporary kitchens, with strong dealer margins.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/shiloh-cabinetry">Shiloh Cabinetry</a></strong> — Custom paint, <a href="/playbook/modern-inset">inset</a>, and white-oak finishes for transitional coastal looks.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm German Kitchens</a></strong> — Handleless European fronts for high-end La Jolla and Rancho Santa Fe homes, with protected territory.</li>
  <li><strong><a href="/brands/aspect-cabinetry">Aspect Cabinetry</a></strong> — Semi-custom value for ADUs and rental properties.</li>
</ul>

<h2 id="san-diego-market-opportunity">The San Diego Market Opportunity</h2>
<p>San Diego kitchens lean light and coastal — white and warm-neutral palettes, white-oak and walnut accents, natural textures, and seamless connections to outdoor living. The luxury coastal communities of La Jolla, Del Mar, and Rancho Santa Fe increasingly favor handleless <a href="/brands/pronorm-german-kitchens">Pronorm</a> and <a href="/brands/eclipse-cabinetry">frameless</a> kitchens, while inland and North County remodels keep transitional styling popular — a strong, high-margin market for dealers carrying the right lines.</p>

<h2 id="dealer-support">Dealer Support That Drives Sales</h2>
<p>Pinnacle Sales backs San Diego dealers with hands-on sales training, 2020/Winner design and quoting support, showroom display programs, and ongoing business development. We work alongside your team to move projects from concept to order.</p>

